{"version":1,"content":"<p>阿根廷受厄爾尼諾現象影響，引發連場暴雨，當地旅遊景點伊瓜蘇瀑布（Iguazu Falls）因水位急升，當局擔心引發河水氾濫，周一（12日）一度將其關閉。</p><p>當局其後表示，隨着河水流量回落，園區已於今日（13日）重新開放。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.074063+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:39:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723897+00:00","content_hash":"ef91252ea5fef875c9542ccc89a01db943898f0934f5f371cb6f335e71731a62","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}